&lt;p&gt;As an Emerging Enterprise Account Executive at Databricks, you come with relevant experience selling to Emerging Enterprise ($250 - $1B revenue) accounts in France. As a successful candidate you are a self-starter who understands the consumption sales process. You know how to sell innovation and value to existing customers, identify new use cases and grow consumption and can guide deals forward to compress decision cycles. You love understanding a product in-depth and are passionate about communicating its value to customers and partners. You will be offered huge potential for career progression with the pace of the team&#39;s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
